gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "If you're a fascist, you're not welcome\n"
	.string "to play this game.\p"
	.string "It's against the rules.\p"
	.string "If you're reading this and thinking,\p"
	.string "“You just call everyone you disagree\n"
	.string "with a fascist,” then you're probably a\l"
	.string "fascist, or incapable of drawing\p"
	.string "inferences from context and\n"
	.string "acknowledging a dangerous political\l"
	.string "climate that causes the oppressed\p"
	.string "to be hyperbolic.\p"
	.string "Don't play this game.\p"
	.string "Heal yourself.\p"
	.string "Grow.\p"
	.string "Learn.\p"
	.string "Watch some Mr. Rogers' Neighborhood or\n"
	.string "something.\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "This hack was made for transfems,\n"
	.string "by a non-binary transfem lesbian.\p"
	.string "A lot of the changes were made with\n"
	.string "this as the primary viewpoint.\p"
	.string "If you aren't a transfem, you're\n"
	.string "absolutely welcome to play, and I hope\l"
	.string "you do and enjoy yourself!\p"
	.string "Just please understand that this is\n"
	.string "primarily a labor of love for myself\l"
	.string "and my transfem sisters.\p"
	.string "I love you all. {EMOJI_HEART}\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "In this hack, both the player\n"
	.string "and the rival are over 21, \p"
	.string "and all POKéMON are females.\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "By the way, this version uses\n"
	.string "subtle differences between encounter\p"
	.string "tiles to show which areas contain\n"
	.string "new POKéMON. Pay very close attention\l"
	.string "to where you're searching!\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting on\n"
	.string "Kaya's preamble!\l"
	.string "Welcome to the POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH.\p"
	.string "But everyone calls me the POKéMON.\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "Anyways,\n"
	.string "this is what I call a “Threenis.” \p"
	.string "She's my research assistant!\l"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Threenis and I have been\n"
	.string "undertaking resnearch.\l"
	.string "That's what we do!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "What about you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "What's your style?\n"
	.string "Yes, these are your only options.$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, okay!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN} who's moving to my\n"
	.string "hometown of LITTLEROOT.\l"
	.string "I get it now!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your very own adventure is about\n"
	.string "to unfold.\p"
	.string "Take courage, and leap into the\n"
	.string "world of POKéMON where dreams,\l"
	.string "adventure, and friendships with benefits\n"
	.string "await!\p"
	.string "Well, I'll be expecting you later.\n"
	.string "Come see me in my POKéMON LAB.\p"
	.string "Or idk maybe I'll be in the grass\n"
	.string "outside the town. Who knows? Not me!\p"
	.string "$"

